      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROAR OF THUNDER (2) has a strong record this track and trip with three wins and two placings from nine starts. Hit the frame latest (22.66) when third at Shepparton in a Rank Limit - Grade 5. With a clean break looks hard to beat. ASTON OUTLAY (1) scored an upset win at big odds last time in a Grade 5 at this track (19.04). Solid record here winning five races. Comes through a solid form race last start. Deserves serious consideration again. HEY MARTY (3) goes very well this course and distance starting 18 times for six wins and four minors. Recorded a 1.75 lengths win (18.98) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. Can hit the frame with the right run. FENELLA (8) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
